    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>他山之石，可以功玉。遇到瓶颈时，想破头都想不出的破局之道，也许就在别处。不要把思维一直深埋在自己销售产品的类目中，也不要把视野总是限制在自己所处的行业中。影视剧作也能带来启发，生活细节也能带来灵感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢贾樟柯的电影，喜欢周轶君的节目，喜欢怪奇物语，喜欢杭州这个季节枫叶和银杏叶带来的红黄交错。没有生活的生活方式品牌，都是不能引起共鸣的假模假样。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 贾樟柯访谈带来的启发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 先遵守商业道德再谈本土化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 六十分的产品简单粗暴营销也行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> Do one thing and do it well.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 亚马逊的轻舟和用户的心智</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 怪奇物语小11的品牌可学习之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 宠物用品品牌给消费者的印象对比</span></p><span></span><p><span>关联文章扩展阅读：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/f6Q-GGyp0unZXvYlXcBSRw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/f6Q-GGyp0unZXvYlXcBSRw"><span>文章1</span></a><span>；</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UPKOA0SXu_GSFtMXM1l3DQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UPKOA0SXu_GSFtMXM1l3DQ"><span>文章2</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FovTV7sStOZsHloS1QF2tFEEjlqp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkNedUKlGkR18go-fYtFcQxlOEBR.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtEc1Z7XVJ4K19MDfJW_Y3Isg9-T.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWKj4JJRWvS10YcxrF6U-6XYMi_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZWA0oGfTso_rDaE__eDe_4IFUY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtibMkcx30H_heKc5UZbx2pzuBk1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrU28h3C8ECqVAHAr3f-CfMzEQTH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp4ifp4oNmlZQRk4GqQNd3RKPdE6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjMDDcFMAbdiV4Wk2LlvXf6F7zUP.png"></figure>]]></description>
